xt":"Splitter is expected to give him point-forward duties. Without Giddey last season (23 games) his assists rose from 2.1 to 3.5 per 36.","sources":["https://youtu.be/FxaSnyk9g90?t=396","https://youtu.be/sTtFUy7IoJI?t=1218","stats"]},{"field":"multipliers.reb","text":"Slight rebound cut at small forward next to Wilson and Claxton. His blocks are already about 12% lower per minute in the base than last season, so I did not cut them again.","sources":["https://youtu.be/3Qm5wLjhvTw?t=1812","https://youtu.be/3Qm5wLjhvTw?t=515","stats"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}